===== OpenWrt support =====

The device is currently supported as [[releases:snapshot|Development builds / snapshots]].
  * Sysupgrade https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/targets/ramips/mt7620/openwrt-ramips-mt7620-edimax_br-6208ac-v2-squashfs-sysupgrade.bin
  * Initramfs https://downloads.openwrt.org/snapshots/targets/ramips/mt7620/openwrt-ramips-mt7620-edimax_br-6208ac-v2-initramfs-kernel.bin


==== Installation ====
Openwrt can be either installed by uploading the sysupgrade image via the default web interface. 
Or it can be installed through uboot with by providing the image from a tftp server and attach a serial console to tell uboot to do so.
